This distribution contains IIC-RALF by Jakob Ratschenberger,
Johannes Kepler University, Institute for Integrated Circuits.
Upstream: https://github.com/iic-jku/IIC-RALF

The bundled copy contains local routing/export and Magic cleanup changes.
Packaging changes dated 2026-11-03 add a portable Qt workbench distribution,
local path configuration, isolated dependency installation, verification scripts,
and configurable, safely quoted Magic process calls.
Original copyright and license notices are retained in the source files.
